sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Visitor
    participant W as Web app
    participant A as AuthController
    participant S as AuthService
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant M as SMTP relay

    U->>W: submit registration
    W->>A: POST /api/auth/register
    A->>S: RegisterAsync(dto)
    S->>S: hash password (BCrypt)
    S->>DB: insert User (IsEmailVerified = false)
    S->>DB: store verification token hash (60 min)
    S->>M: send verification link
    S-->>A: Created
    A-->>W: 201 (identical whether or not the address exists)
    Note over A,W: no account-existence oracle
    U->>W: open link
    W->>A: POST /api/auth/verify-email
    A->>S: VerifyAsync(token)
    S->>DB: match hash, check expiry, single use
    S->>DB: set IsEmailVerified = true
    S-->>A: Ok
    A-->>W: 200 - sign-in now permitted
